   ],
   "fitness_value_in_ancestor": "a polynomial forward pass replaces most of the exponential backward search",
   "failure_landscape": "by reading: the graph is built on GROUND actions (all instantiations), so large domains blow up here first (MAXNODES); delete effects are stored on the action as strings and consulted only for mutexes",
